<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>Appointment Letter</title>

<%- include("./partials/styles") %>

</head>

<body>

<div class="document">

<div class="corner corner-tl"></div>
<div class="corner corner-tr"></div>
<div class="corner corner-bl"></div>
<div class="corner corner-br"></div>

<div style="text-align:center;">

<%- include("./partials/arsp-logo") %>

<h2
style="
margin:10px 0 4px;
color:#0B6B3A;
font-size:26px;">

<%= setting.organization_name %>

</h2>

<div style="font-size:15px;">

Official Appointment Order

</div>

<div
style="
margin-top:6px;
font-size:13px;
color:#555;">

Registration No :
<%= setting.registration_number || "-" %>

</div>

</div>

<hr
style="
margin:18px 0;
border:1px solid #0B6B3A;">

<table
style="
width:100%;
font-size:14px;">

<tr>

<td>

<strong>

Reference No.

</strong>

</td>

<td>

<%= documentNumber %>

</td>

<td style="text-align:right;">

<strong>

Date

</strong>

</td>

<td style="text-align:right;">

<%= new Date(position.appointed_at).toLocaleDateString("en-GB") %>

</td>

</tr>

</table>

<div
style="
margin-top:25px;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:flex-start;">

<div style="width:72%;">

<p>

To,

</p>

<p>

<strong>

Mr. <%= member.full_name %>

</strong>

</p>

<p>

Member ID :

<strong>

<%= member.member_id %>

</strong>

</p>

<p>

District :

<%= member.district %>

</p>

<p>

State :

<%= member.state %>

</p>

</div>

<div
style="
width:120px;
text-align:center;">

<img

src="<%= member.photo ? '/uploads/arsp-members/' + member.photo : '/images/default-user.png' %>"

style="
width:110px;
height:135px;
border:2px solid #0B6B3A;
object-fit:cover;">

</div>

</div>

<hr
style="
margin:20px 0;">




<h3
style="
margin:0;
text-align:center;
color:#0B6B3A;">

SUBJECT: APPOINTMENT AS <%= position.designation.toUpperCase() %>

</h3>

<div
style="
margin-top:20px;
font-size:14px;
line-height:1.6;
text-align:justify;">

<p>

Dear <strong>Mr. <%= member.full_name %></strong>,

</p>

<p>

We are pleased to inform you that you have been appointed as
<strong><%= position.designation %></strong>
under the
<strong><%= position.section %></strong>
of
<strong><%= setting.organization_name %></strong>
with effect from
<strong><%= new Date(position.appointed_at).toLocaleDateString("en-GB") %></strong>.

</p>

<p>

This appointment is made in recognition of your dedication, integrity and willingness to contribute towards social welfare, community development and the objectives of the organisation. You are expected to perform your duties faithfully, maintain discipline, uphold the Constitution of the organisation and comply with all policies and decisions issued by the competent authority.

</p>

<p>

Your appointment shall remain valid unless amended, suspended or withdrawn by the organisation in accordance with its rules and regulations.

</p>

<p>

We congratulate you on your appointment and wish you success in serving the community through <strong><%= setting.organization_name %></strong>.

</p>

</div>

<table
class="table"
style="margin-top:20px;">

<tr>

<td style="width:35%;"><strong>Designation</strong></td>

<td><%= position.designation %></td>

</tr>

<tr>

<td><strong>Committee</strong></td>

<td><%= position.committee_name || "-" %></td>

</tr>

<tr>

<td><strong>Section</strong></td>

<td><%= position.section %></td>

</tr>

<tr>

<td><strong>Appointment Date</strong></td>

<td><%= new Date(position.appointed_at).toLocaleDateString("en-GB") %></td>

</tr>

</table>



<div
style="
margin-top:25px;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:flex-end;">

<div>

<% if(member.qr_code){ %>

<img
src="/uploads/arsp-qr/<%= member.qr_code %>"
style="width:80px;height:80px;">

<br>

<small>Scan to Verify</small>

<% } %>

</div>

<div
style="
text-align:center;
font-size:12px;
color:#555;
width:220px;">

This is a computer-generated official Appointment Letter of

<strong>

<%= setting.organization_name %>

</strong>.

</div>

<% if(setting && setting.official_seal){ %>

<img
src="/uploads/arsp-settings/<%= setting.official_seal %>"
style="
width:90px;
height:90px;
object-fit:contain;">

<% }else{ %>

<div
style="
width:90px;
height:90px;
border:2px dashed #0B6B3A;
border-radius:50%;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-size:12px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#0B6B3A;">

OFFICIAL<br>SEAL

</div>

<% } %>

</div>

<div
style="
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
margin-top:25px;">
<div style="width:30%;text-align:center;">

<div style="height:35px;"></div>

<hr>

<strong>

Appointee

</strong>

</div>

<div style="width:30%;text-align:center;">

<div style="height:35px;"></div>

<hr>

<strong>

Registration Officer

</strong>

</div>

<div style="width:30%;text-align:center;">

<% if(setting && setting.president_signature){ %>
<img
src="/uploads/arsp-settings/<%= setting.president_signature %>"
style="
height:30px;
max-width:140px;
display:block;
margin:0 auto;
object-fit:contain;">
<% }else{ %>

<div style="height:20px;"></div>
<% } %>

<hr>

<strong>

President / Authorised Signatory

</strong>

</div>

</div>

<div
style="
margin-top:20px;
border-top:2px solid #0B6B3A;
padding-top:10px;
font-size:11px;
text-align:center;
color:#666;">

Appointment Ref:
<%= documentNumber %>

&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;

Generated:
<%= new Date().toLocaleString("en-GB") %>

</div>

<div
style="
margin-top:20px;
text-align:center;">

<button
class="btn-print"
onclick="window.print()">

🖨 Print Appointment Letter

</button>

</div>

</div>

</body>

</html>
